    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This methodology has been successfully applied in our company's past references, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer projects." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To maintain decision traceability, our company's will establish a joint steering committee with the client, meeting monthly, and an operational committee meeting fortnightly. our company's single accountable project director will serve as the client point of contact, ensuring clear communication and escalation paths when needed. our company's will also maintain a RACI matrix to track responsibilities and decisions throughout The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). our company's dedicated team for The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will consist of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, with additional resources available for change management and training. our company's have confirmed availability for The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB), and Our dedicated team for this project expertise aligns well with the requirements of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). our company's will leverage our company's consortium partners, such as OuraneCloud for hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure and Ligeo Santé for health-IT integration, to ensure seamless integration with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following our company's governance practices, including regular meetings, documented escalation paths, and a focus on decision traceability, our company's can ensure the successful coordination of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) while maintaining transparency and accountability. our company's past experiences in similar projects and our company's commitment to agile methodologies will enable our company's to deliver a high-quality solution within the estimated budget of 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide response times compatible with daily clinical use (below 2 seconds), integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), and have an availability target of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with user directories, have API-type interfaces, and rely on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, here are the coverage levels for each requirement: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times compatible with daily clinical use (below 2 seconds): FULLY COVERED our platform's performance metrics indicate that common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95, and complex multi-source synthesis queries may reach up to 2.5 seconds at p95, which is close to the requirement. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI): FULLY COVERED our architecture and integration capabilities include standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration, as well as custom adapters where needed. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR): FULLY COVERED our have a production-ready FHIR HL7 connector with extended resource coverage on the roadmap, ensuring support for health interoperability standards. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Availability target of 99.9%: FULLY COVERED our availability target is 99.9%, and our achieve Availability target of 99.9% through active-active deployment across two availability zones, ensuring high uptime and redundancy. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with user directories: FULLY COVERED our support integration with user directories such as LDAP and Entra ID, using SSO protocols like SAML and OIDC. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API-type interfaces: FULLY COVERED The solution is designed with an API-first approach (REST + webhook), providing documented APIs that can be easily embedded in existing work environments. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Rely on low-carbon infrastructure: FULLY COVERED our hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier, which is powered by renewable energy and meets the EU-only requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would involve deploying our Atelier platform on the Sovereign HDS tier, which is powered by renewable energy and meets the EU-only requirement, utilizing our standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration, and leveraging our FHIR HL7 connector for health interoperability standards support. our would also integrate with user directories using SSO protocols and provide API-type interfaces for easy embedding in existing work environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our would ensure that our platform is deployed on low-carbon infrastructure to meet the sustainability requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must guarantee strict compliance with the GDPR, health data is processed as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9), medical confidentiality (secret médical) must be preserved, and sensitive data must be protected by encryption or pseudonymisation where relevant." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be performed on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
