    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security controls can we implement to ensure compliance with these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with the GDPR and the specific requirements mentioned, we, can implement several security controls. we are already certified for ISO 27001, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, including data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For health data, being special-category data under GDPR Art. 9, we apply strict measures such as encryption at rest using AES-256 and in transit with TLS 1.3, ensuring that all sensitive information is protected. we infrastructure, operated on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, meets the hosting requirements. we also implement pseudonymisation where relevant to further protect sensitive data, along with data minimization principles to only process the necessary amount of data for our services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The configurable retention of data ensures that we comply with the GDPR regulations regarding data storage periods." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, we access controls include Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), ensuring that only authorized personnel can access and manage health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Audit logging is in place to track all system outputs and accesses, providing transparency and accountability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we ISO 27701 certification, which extends we information security management system to include privacy information management, we are well-equipped to handle the preservation of medical confidentiality (secret médical). we Data Protection Officer (DPO) oversees these processes, ensuring that we data processing activities comply with GDPR Art. 28 and maintaining a data processing register." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) includes practices such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider to identify and mitigate any vulnerabilities in we systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these security controls, we can ensure compliance with the the GDPR requirements for health data processing, preservation of medical confidentiality, protection of sensitive data, and adherence to SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, health-data hosting (HDS) certification, and explainability and traceability of recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No clinical or medico-administrative decision may be automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, I can confirm that we maintain strict compliance with GDPR, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements, as part of we regulatory obligations monitoring." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we have experience with the HDS framework, which is relevant for health data hosting certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explainability and traceability, we AI models, such as the sovereign European open-weight model used under we open-weight license, provide a level of transparency that can support explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must note that our company context does not explicitly mention the provision of audit trails or source grounding for medical responsibility, which might be required for full compliance with the explainability and traceability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for the automation of clinical or medico-administrative decisions, our company context clearly states that we operate as a non-decisional support tool, ensuring that no clinical or medico-administrative decision is automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional. operate aligns with the regulatory requirements mentioned in The tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these points, potential legal risks to flag include ensuring that the solution explainability and traceability capabilities meet the specific requirements of The tender, as well as maintaining rigorous compliance with GDPR and HDS certification standards. we should also verify that we contractual agreements and data processing arrangements are fully aligned with the regulatory requirements outlined in The tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of compliance, based on our company context, it appears that we have a solid foundation for meeting the regulatory requirements related to GDPR, HDS certification, and non-automated decision-making." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

